<title>ITALY: RALLYING-SAN REMO RALLY POSITIONS.</title>
<headline>RALLYING-SAN REMO RALLY POSITIONS.</headline>
<dateline>GUBBIO, Italy 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading positions after</p>
<p>the second special stage of the San Remo rally on Monday:</p>
<p> 1. Andrea Dallavilla (Italy) Toyota Celica   36 minutes 8</p>
<p>seconds</p>
<p>2. Gilberto Pianezzola (Italy) Toyota Celica  3 seconds behind</p>
<p> 3. Andrea Navarra (Italy) Subaru Impreza	6</p>
<p> 4. Colin McRae (Britain) Subaru Impreza	 7</p>
<p> 5. Piero Liatti (Italy) Subaru Impreza	 11</p>
<p>6. Kenneth Eriksson (Sweden) Subaru Impreza  13</p>
</text>
